<title>EGYPT: Egypt offers 91-day T-bills worth 600 mln pounds.</title>
<headline>Egypt offers 91-day T-bills worth 600 mln pounds.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Egyptian treasury offered 91-day treasury bills worth 600 million pounds for auction on April 2 and issue on April 3 when 91-day bills worth 610.900 million pounds mature.</p>
<p>The average yield at the last auction was 9.765 percent.</p>
<p>($1 = 3.40 pounds)</p>
</text>
